              19 iters
Gauss-Seidel  Ax=b -> [0.9999999999999978, 0.9999999999999989, 0.9999999999999998]
              17 iters  (fresh values -> fewer than Jacobi)

Power iteration dominant eigenvalue -> 2  (14 iters, expect ~2)

